    "$t": "導師人生"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>郤佳源</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規工--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">功課無寫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mi̍h件koh無紮</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聯絡簿仔序大無簽名</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">全齣頭--了-了</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規工--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">衫穿bē pih-tsah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsíng甲koh m̄鉸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sian講to講bē聽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規工--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Pùn-sò sì-kè有</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上課tuh-ku</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">手機仔koh偷lu</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā lé koh愛諍</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hông感覺規腹肚火</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規工--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下課lóng愛烏白舞</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">查埔--ê愛做tshit仔詼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh愛揣人冤家</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">查某--ê愛風騷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā愛sio招去便所</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">講人ê閒仔話</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規工--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐工惱tsia有--ê無--ê就飽--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tse就是</span></p></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">導師規工ê khang-khuè</span></p></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有影是規工--ê</span></p></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlaNg-8SN0yj3crY30aSpfMULyyXuf6KPLjvnuMBEQXhAFRRg_swPlwklLajDMRHyYgriIkxz4iZacC2GCrwpiaGxhpbGGDQeeEMn9QQU9Qa0nuo4KCwtWN15-84OKdVQWNz2uP_cFve6HIllH4fLnJnGr_0Dg4efF-DmVK7FW2Es7NuLYWBU0DJN5q1sx/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1366%E6%9C%9F_05_A.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlaNg-8SN0yj3crY30aSpfMULyyXuf6KPLjvnuMBEQXhAFRRg_swPlwklLajDMRHyYgriIkxz4iZacC2GCrwpiaGxhpbGGDQeeEMn9QQU9Qa0nuo4KCwtWN15-84OKdVQWNz2uP_cFve6HIllH4fLnJnGr_0Dg4efF-DmVK7FW2Es7NuLYWBU0DJN5q1sx/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1366%E6%9C%9F_05_A.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDO3GNqkvxT_vbBsnqnl7cDGrifdurgIOO85gebh02Vx6OrV-4jriiDG0Bil1WwGe3ti_MqrATu3mY_5ylHrPFTmaQrXUbQ1hjG23fNAKYgxXNbr0F94pKb4RLhNZcvF1EaukywPB9PeP9N2xgcFk0N7KX7PcDQWCU3ReJFwwBUr-4mwweryuPX3seCtG-/s1421/366%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDO3GNqkvxT_vbBsnqnl7cDGrifdurgIOO85gebh02Vx6OrV-4jriiDG0Bil1WwGe3ti_MqrATu3mY_5ylHrPFTmaQrXUbQ1hjG23fNAKYgxXNbr0F94pKb4RLhNZcvF1EaukywPB9PeP9N2xgcFk0N7KX7PcDQWCU3ReJFwwBUr-4mwweryuPX3seCtG-/w450-h640/366%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2